OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry start with variable
OL,6,Famounts of cloud and bright or sunny
OL,7,Fspells. Cloud increasing from the west
OL,8,Fin the afternoon, with some outbreaks
OL,9,Fof rain, especially in southern areas.
OL,10,FFeeling warm and humid. Windy,
OL,11,Fgradually easing later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud and patchy light rain
OL,14,Fand drizzle will slowly clear away
OL,15,Ffrom southern areas. Becoming dry with
OL,16,Fvariable amounts of cloud and clear
OL,17,Fspells developing. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
