OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FSunday will be fine and dry
OL,6,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and
OL,7,Fbright or sunny spells. Feeling warm
OL,8,Fin the sunshine, with light winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,11,Fwill be fine with variable cloud and
OL,12,Fbright or sunny spells. Feeling warmer
OL,13,Fwith light winds. Dry with warm sunny
OL,14,Fspells Tuesday. Cloudier on Wednesday.
OL,15,FSome cool nights.
